# OCI build context excludes. The server images build from the monorepo root
# (ProjectReference to src/libs/), restoring from nuget.org only. Keep the
# context lean and never ship build output or VCS metadata into a layer.
**/bin
**/obj
**/.git
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/TestResults
*.user
*.suo
# Local secrets / env — never enter an image layer.
*.env
.env
.env.*
appsettings.*.Local.json
